  "流程存储达到 2 MB 上限；旧记录未覆盖，请导出整库": "Procedure storage reached 2 MB. Old records were not overwritten; export the library.",
  "基于 Tesla 于 2026 年 10 月公开的新 Roadster 演示制作。这里的已核实指官方公开披露及可见演示；不代表已获得量产车数据或通过真车标定。": "Based on Tesla’s publicly disclosed October 2026 Roadster demonstration. “Confirmed” here means public official statements and visible demonstrations, not production-car data or physical calibration.",
  "© Tesla · Roadster 官方图片，仅作外形参考；本项目为非官方仿真研究。": "© Tesla · Official Roadster image for exterior reference. This is an unofficial simulation research project.",
  "Tesla · Roadster 官方产品页": "Tesla · Official Roadster product page",
  "官方产品说明": "Official product description",
  "多模式风扇与地面密封系统抽走车底空气，产生足以静止倒挂的吸附力。": "Multimode fans and ground seals remove air beneath the car to generate suction, including while stationary and inverted.",
  "冷气推进器采用电动执行器，在不足一秒的时间尺度内调整推力以稳定飞行。": "Cold-gas thrusters use electric actuators to adjust thrust on a sub-second timescale for flight stabilization.",
  "Performance 为双座，提供主动空气动力与风扇吸附；Thrust 为双座，增加后部冷气推进；Rocket 为单座，增加周边推进器以支持向前、向上加速及横向旋转。": "Performance has two seats, active aerodynamics and fan suction. Thrust adds rear cold-gas propulsion. The single-seat Rocket adds perimeter thrusters for forward/upward acceleration and lateral rotation.",
  "Track Mode 可降低车身并改变悬架状态，可选择高下压力或低阻力模式。": "Track Mode can lower the body and adjust suspension state, with high-downforce or low-drag modes.",
  "Tesla · Roadster Event（完整发布演示）": "Tesla · Roadster Event (complete presentation)",
  "官方视频 · 23 分 21 秒": "Official video · 23 min 21 s",
  "Tesla 官方视频简介给出的章节：斜坡演示 6:03–10:55，Kickflip 10:56–12:43，设计 12:47–14:38，空气动力 14:38–15:57，0–60 mph 演示 15:58–19:26。": "Chapters in Tesla’s official video description: ramp 6:03–10:55, kickflip 10:56–12:43, design 12:47–14:38, aerodynamics 14:38–15:57, and 0–60 mph demonstration 15:58–19:26.",
  "发布演示为研发车辆公开演示，不能直接替代完整的车辆参数集或独立测试报告。": "A public development-vehicle demonstration does not replace a complete vehicle parameter set or independent test report.",
  "Tesla · The Ramp | Roadster": "Tesla · The Ramp | Roadster",
  "官方演示视频 · 46 秒": "Official demonstration video · 46 s",
  "演示车辆沿弯曲坡面驶入倒置姿态，随后离开坡面，利用冷气喷流改变姿态并落地。": "The demonstration vehicle drives along a curved ramp into an inverted attitude, leaves the ramp, changes attitude using cold-gas jets, and lands.",
  "Tesla · The Kickflip | Roadster": "Tesla · The Kickflip | Roadster",
  "官方演示视频 · 44 秒": "Official demonstration video · 44 s",
  "演示车辆从地面喷气跃起，空中滚转并越过排列的车辆后落地。": "The demonstration vehicle launches from the ground with jets, rolls over a line of parked cars, and lands.",
  "Tesla · Roadster | The Last Best Driver's Car": "Tesla · Roadster | The Last Best Driver’s Car",
  "官方设计与技术简介 · 86 秒": "Official design and technology introduction · 86 s",
  "2026 年设计包含隐藏式前灯、贯穿式尾灯、平齐空气动力表面、轻量细辐轮毂、Ano White 白色车身与带金铜色效果的车窗。": "The 2026 design includes concealed headlights, a full-width rear light, flush aerodynamic surfaces, lightweight thin-spoke wheels, Ano White paint and glazing with a gold/copper effect.",
  "官方说明座椅位置固定，并使用镁、钛和碳纤维等材料减重。": "The official description states that seat positions are fixed and magnesium, titanium and carbon fiber reduce weight.",
  "官方简介同时确认了静止倒挂的抽吸原理以及冷气推进器的电动执行器。": "The introduction also describes fan suction for stationary inversion and electric actuators for the cold-gas thrusters.",
  "Tesla · 2026 Roadster 设计语言": "Tesla · 2026 Roadster design language",
