  "Tesla 说明新设计语言已从早期车型演变，并以 SR-71 与 F-35 为灵感。": "Tesla describes an evolved design language inspired by the SR-71 and F-35.",
  "Tesla · 冷气储存与推进硬件": "Tesla · Cold-gas storage and propulsion hardware",
  "Tesla 说明车辆采用碳纤维缠绕压力容器（COPV）储存压缩气体，并针对车辆环境设计了新的硬件与控制。": "Tesla describes compressed-gas storage in carbon-overwrapped pressure vessels (COPVs), with new hardware and controls designed for an automotive environment.",
  "Tesla · Roadster 侧视官方参考图": "Tesla · Official Roadster side-view reference",
